Anda harus melanjutkan misi Anda.

489
00:29:42.145 --> 00:29:43.476
Sangat baik.

490
00:29:43.513 --> 00:29:46.482
Kepala, bawa mereka ke permukaan planet ini.

491
00:29:46.516 --> 00:29:47.984
Ayo ya sir.

492
00:29:48.985 --> 00:29:50.953
Kita harus menenangkan dia.

493
00:29:51.020 --> 00:29:52.282
20 cc dari melorazine.

494
